  "batch": "d6f40ea6-e2ea-4527-a0cf-e40d35490eff",
  "caveats": "Each ZIP download contains the original scanned TIFF files for a single calendar\nyear, including monthly and dekadal scans. The files are provided in a ZIP archive\nto preserve the original sources and may be extracted and converted as needed.\n\n\nWhile ERA5 provides complete spatial coverage, it is a model reanalysis and may overestimate\ndrizzle or miss localized convective storms common in the tropics. Users should compare\nthis product with the GPCC-based CDI where gauge data is available to understand\npotential biases in the reanalysis inputs.",
